abstract: "ForestTime is an Android mobile application for IUFRO-standardized direct-observation time studies in forest operations. Version 5.4.0 implements retrospective completed-element recording, clarified cycle-boundary handling, configurable live sample-size estimation, local persistence, crash recovery, and structured export to CSV, JSON, and R."
